 "title": "Register of Deeds",
 "text": "Register of Deeds\nOctober 18, 2026\nMoody County, South Dakota\nHome\nAbout\nDepartments »\nAuditor\nEmergency Management\nEqualization\nExtension\nHighway\nRegister of Deeds\nSheriff’s Department\nState’s Attorney\nTreasurer\nVeteran’s Office\nZoning\nCommissioners »\nCommission Agenda\nCommission Minutes\nCounty Ordinances\nEmployment\nQuick Links\nYou are here: Home / Register of Deeds\nRegister of Deeds\nRegister of Deeds – Brittany Bennett\nDeputy Register of Deeds – Chris Wellman\nPhone: 605-997-3151\nAddress: 101 E. Pipestone Ave. Ste. C, Flandreau, SD 57028\nEmail: mcrod1@moodycounty.net\nThe Register of Deeds Department is responsible for recording, indexing, preserving, and maintaining real property documents, financing statements, birth, death, marriage, military discharge and notary public records in accordance with South Dakota General Statutes and local ordinances. The department assists attorneys, paralegals, realtors, surveyors, banking officers, and the general public with the retrieval of these permanent records and issues certified copies to the recipient. The Register of Deeds is an elected position.\nCost for Certified Copies\nBirth Certificate $15.00\nDeath Certificate $15.00\nMarriage Certificate $15.00\nCredit card orders accepted\nMoody County E-Records\nTo obtain a marriage license, both parties need to come into the office with photo ID, cost is $40.00. License may be purchased same day as marriage, but not more than 90 days in advance of marriage date.\nForms:\nOrder Vital Records\nMarriage, Death, Birth Record Application\nCertificate of Real Estate Value\nVital Record Military Fee Waiver Request\nUCC FILINGS ON COUNTY LEVEL\nFederal Tax Lien Search\neRecording Procedures\nDocument Recording Checklist\nCredit Card Phone Orders\nFee Schedule\nCommission Meeting October 20, 2026 9:00 am – 11:00 am\nTabulator Test October 27, 2026 3:00 pm – 4:00 pm\nGeneral Election November 3, 2026 7:00 am – 7:00 pm\nCommission Meeting – Election Canvass November 9, 2026 9:00 am – 11:00 am\nWeather\nReturn to top of page\nCopyright © 2026 on Genesis Framework · WordPress · Log in",
